{
  "id": "1CH.23",
  "number": "23",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Damanyoojiga 23",
  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "23",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea niwaasiit Dawdi nea nisaang'ayiit gweanyeakaaschi, ghwanung' ghoah orjeedaanyi siguura Sulemani sugoocheanda jea goombal Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gadiyoojiga fuga Lawi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabwada geat Dawdi fuga hees sean bea Israeli ea ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga Lawi bea gweanyeew diktam ea damanamughuush ea ghwanaawa, geeyiida, mooneeda nyaawa ea sagalamnyooji diktam ea damasis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba jeedeaba fiisu sagalamnyooji diktam ea ang'wan fuga jea gamiineadaysa gadiyeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea fih sagalamnyooji lah gayghoah fuga hees ea fuga laja girgweaguutka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea fih sagalamnyooji ang'wan gayghoah furiischoodiga dooshta, nea fih sagalamnyooji ang'wan gayghoaghaambiit NG'UTAMIIDA aba dabita sarmeeda easinyi jea eakghaambiit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwanung' Dawdi gwajip geat nea gwasin geenga aba gidabeada orjooga Lawi: Gershomu, ea Gohati, ea Merari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Gershomu: Ladani gil ea Shimeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Ladani: Yehieli siida haweewa saawa gil, ea Setamu, ea Yoeli, saawa ea samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Shimeyi: Shelomoti, ea Hasieli, ea Harani, saawa ea samwagu. Suh fuga hees gil aba gealga ghweaniga nyaawa bea dooshta Ladani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea orjooga Shimeyi: ea Yahati gil, ea Sina, ea Yeushi, sea Beriya. Suh asang'waniin orjooga Shimeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahati siida hawi, nea Sisa ea deaba iyeenya; nea Yeushi ea Beriya ea mandeawana orjooga saang'a, hean ghoah fugeaba gheawi bea ghwaaniin iisiyiiduudayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Gohati: Amramu gil, ea Ishari, ea Hebroni, ea Usieli, saawa ea ang'wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Amramu: Haruni gil ea Musa. Haruni geasach gwasin gadiyeeda haleanjeeda ghaydidi muuchi, nea gideaba niny ea orjoagaaschi gaygagwariida geediga ng'andidi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea gagadiiyeesa niny nea ghoadayda ghawooda aba gheawungaaschi damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea orjooga Musa was siida ASEETA geerugu aba jeeda dooshta Lawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Musa: Gershomu gil, ea Elieseri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Gershomu: Siida haw geeguura Shebueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elieseri gaba orjeanagi was Rehabiyahi gwandeawa diibiga saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Ishari: aahaw Shelomoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Hebroni: Yeriyahi was dea haw, ea Amariya siideaba iyeenya, Yahasieli deaba samwagu, ea Yekameyamu deaba ang'wani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Usieli: Mika gil was dea haw ea Ishiya deaba iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Merari: Mahli gil ea Mushi. Orjooga Mahli: Elieseri gil ea Gishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghami Elieseri nea mii gwaji orjeeda geaghus haweega; sea buweadeagaaschi; was Orjooga Gishi ak ghaghi haweesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Mushi: Mahli gil, ea Ederi, ea Yeremoti, saawa ea samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh orjooga Lawi aba dooshta ghweaniga nyaawa was fuga hees bea gealga nyaawa damanda sing'waara mooneeda gheawunga giliwas sih ng'eada gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwayi Dawdi, “NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli, niidaw fugaaschi hoyyoo; ak gaygoobiida Yerusalemu damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea maygudu gagasa fuga sigadiydooscheata.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba ng'asheega huuydean bea Dawdi suh ea mooneeda siyiida bea Lawi ghang'eada gweanyeew diktam ak gwadiyeada, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“gadiyeeda nyaawa gayghaweat orjooga Haruni aba gadiyeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea gadiyeeda nyaawa gayghoah weeta orjooga Haruni aba gadiyeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gang'ula doodoonung'weaka ea jeesinga ghoorajeega, nea goohuun haleanjeeda sean ghaydidi, ea gadiyeeda wassean gasa sinooda aba gheeda ASEETA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gayghaweat eara aba mukaateeyda giihiimnooda, ea dearanga miyaasiin was dearanga sighadoawanda; jea gaba maandaseeda meamwatawiida, ea haleanjeeda sighadoawanda siikuuyi nagheeda, ea giliwas gadiya siiteen ea hawunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghamiinaada giliwas sakteayda, ak gabadiischeesa nea ghoaghaambiit NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwasunu eara shing'ada, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak iissa damanda siitaydaawa haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda bea NG'UTAMIIDA aba eaweeda sabaato, ghana aba ng'ushiinda sheeda ea eawoojiga ghweelmeeda, aba giteena mooneeda sigasa aba heanyaawa, aba gealga sean aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygafur maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa ea heeda ghaydit, nea ghoahaaghwa orjooga Haruni, was buweadeega nyaawa, aba sinooda gadiyeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
